    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a feeling. everything feels so automated. i wake up, i do the same thing, i talk to people but it's all just surface level scripts. i dont feel like a \"person\" anymore, just a unit of data that doesn't actually mean anything to the machine. it feels more logical to just let the program end than to keep running a loop that has no purpose.",
