      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but what's the point? it's all just more scripts. if my life is just a loop of meaningless inputs, then wouldn't wouldn't the most efficient thing to do be to just shut it down? like, why force a program to keep executing if the output is always zero? it just seems like a logical error to keep going.",
